SUMMARY:Thursday Night Mix\, Mingle and Movie Night! (Film Choice: MICHAEL
 )
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n\\*\\*Kindly r
 ead the details carefully below\\*\\*\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s for a great evening of **Mix\, Mingling and the brand new Film- Michael.
 **\n\nMix and Mingle beforehand as we get settled in\, get to know each ot
 her\, share some laughs\, and get ready to see a great film. With a bonus 
 group discussion immidiately following the film.\n\nIncluding a pre-movie 
 mix and mingle\, movie related ice-breaker (to get to know everyone) in th
 e cool (V.I.P lounge)\n\\*Dinner/Food/Beverages avaialbe in the lounge pri
 or to film\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too\; so we can anticipate a gr
 eat turn out\n\n**Where to Meet when you arrive?**\n\n***\\*Meet me and th
 e others right outside the box office beside the air hockey and arcade gam
 es)* (7:00 pm to 7:30 pm)**\n\n{Further Details below:}\n\nSincerely\,\n\n
 Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Thursday Night Mix\,
  Mingle and Movie Night! (Film Choice: MICHAEL)**\n\n-A great night to mix
 \, mingle\, make new friends and go see a great movie\n\n**About Film: Mic
 hael**\n\nThe story of pop superstar Michael Jackson -- from his extraordi
 nary early days in the Jackson 5 to the visionary artist whose creative am
 bition fuels a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the
  world.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**E
 vent Fee:** for Mix and Mingle before and after film\n5 dollars by e trans
 fer in advance to steveflemming11@gmail.com\nor by cash in person)\n\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n(Movie fee- separate- we wi
 ll purchase our ticket together when we all arrive)\n\n**Where and When to
  Find Us?**\n\n**Location:** **(Inside Yonge & Eglinton Centre)**\n2300 Yo
 nge Street\, Toronto\, ON M4P 1E4\n\n**(We will meet out front of box offi
 ce beside the air hockey table and arcade)**\n(Simply walk up the steps fr
 om the outside and come into the Centre- turn left and we will be waiting 
 right there)\n\n**Arrive between 7:00 pm and 7:30 pm**\n(We will head to t
 he V.I.P. lounge for a beverage\, food (optional) before heading to see th
 e film) (optional)\n\n**Close to the Yonge and Eglinton subway**\n(Lots of
  parking in the area and 2 minute walk from the subway station)
