SUMMARY:The Magnificent Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party! (Saturday\, May 2nd)
  
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us
  for a Magnificent May\, Saturday Night Karaoke Party where we will meet a
 t our groups cozy location\, **The Celtic Irish Pub**. **(on main floor)**
  This friendly pub is conveniently located at Yonge & Davisville- very clo
 se to the Davisville subway.\nFree Parking on Duplex (just a block west of
  Yonge)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Where and When to Meet us?**\n**Location: Celt
 ic Irish Pub**\n(Just mention Steve from Meetup when you arrive- to find o
 ur reserved section)\n**Date:** Saturday May 2nd\, 2026\n**Address:** 1954
  Yonge St Toronto\, ON M4S 3E5 (on main floor)\n**Arrive between:** 7:30 p
 m and 9: 30 pm (if you can) (Dinner Menu Provided)\n**Free Parking** on Du
 plex just west of Yonge\n**Taking Subway:** 1 minute walk north of Yonge-D
 avisville Subway\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSteve Flemmin
 g\n(Organizer)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\nEvent Details:\n**The Magnificent Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party! (Satur
 day\, May 2nd)**\n**(On Main floor)**\n\n-We will meet inside (reserved se
 ating) and look forward to a great night to mix\, mingle\, share some laug
 hs and then Karaoke after the mixer\n\n\\*Plan to come for dinner too if y
 ou like (a fabulous dinner menu)\n\\*Invite your friends too\; or come on 
 your own (either way\, we're going to have a blast and make lots of new fr
 iends!)\n\\*Choose to sing or merely enjoy a super enthused energy all nig
 ht long!\n**Please be courteous to the Restaurant and Staff:**\n\\*One bev
 erage (preferably two beverages if you are staying for more than two hours
 ) or appetizer/meal minimum to support the venue-plan to come for dinner t
 oo if you like :)\n\\*Joined by my other groups too\; so we can anticipate
  a fantastic turn out :)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**EVENT FEE and Arrival Times:*
 *\n\n\\*Please arrive between 7:30 pm and 9:30 pm (if you can)\n\n**Event 
 Fee: (Cash only at the door)**\n10 dollars cash or in advance by e transfe
 r too:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*Free Parking on Duplex (block west 
 of Yonge) Residential area\, with paid street parking and parking lot on Y
 onge street
