SUMMARY:🌸🌆 FLEURS DE VILLES: FLORA – BLOOR-YORKVILLE FLOWER WALK A
 ND DINNER 🌆🌸
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n🌸🌆 **FLEURS DE VILLES: FLORA
  – BLOOR-YORKVILLE FLOWER WALK** 🌆🌸\nA Floral Trail\, City Streets
  & A Peak Bloom Experience\nFor a few days each year\, Bloor-Yorkville tra
 nsforms into something completely different — a curated\, walkable flora
 l experience right in the heart of the city.\nJoin us for Fleurs de Villes
 : FLORA\, a one-of-a-kind event where local florists\, designers\, and bus
 inesses come together to “flower-bomb” the neighbourhood with stunning
  installations.\nAnd here’s the bonus — we’re going earlier in the w
 eek\, right during peak viewing time.\nThat means fresher displays\, fewer
  crowds\, and the best chance to experience everything at its fullest.\nEx
 pect to see over 30 creative floral displays popping up in unexpected plac
 es — from fashion-inspired mannequins to floral archways\, window instal
 lations\, and even edible creations along the way.\nThis is not a formal t
 our.\nIt’s a social walk — come explore\, wander\, and take it all in 
 together.\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://
 chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\\*\\*\\*\n🚶‍♂️ **What
  We’ll Do**\nWe’ll meet at the Toronto Reference Library and begin our
  walk through the Bloor-Yorkville area\, following the floral trail and di
 scovering installations as we go.\nThere’s no rush — we’ll take our 
 time\, stop for photos\, and enjoy the creativity of each display.\nAfter 
 the walk\, we’ll head over to Jack Astor's for food\, drinks\, and a cha
 nce to hang out and connect. 🍔🍹\nYou’re welcome to join for food o
 r head out whenever you like.\n\\*\\*\\*\n🌆 **Vibe & Expectations**\nTh
 is is an easy\, relaxed city walk — no distance pressure\, no intensity.
 \nJust:\n✔️ Beautiful visuals\n✔️ A lively neighbourhood\n✔️ G
 ood company\nAlso — this is NOT a guided or historical tour. It’s abou
 t enjoying the experience and being social.\n\\*\\*\\*\n**🧢 Meetup Deta
 ils**\n📍 Meetup Location: Outside the Toronto Reference Library\n🫎 I
 ’ll be wearing my Moose Hat\n⏰ Meetup Time: 6:00 PM\nI will only wait 
