 l & A City in Bloom**\nFor a few days each year\, Bloor-Yorkville transfor
 ms into a living\, walkable art exhibit — filled with flowers\, colour\,
  and creativity around every corner.\nJoin us for Fleurs de Villes VOYAGE\
 , a one-of-a-kind experience where top floral designers partner with local
  businesses to completely “flower-bomb” the neighbourhood.\nThis dayti
