  to wander\, explore\, and really take in the details.\nExpect over 30 uni
 que installations scattered throughout the area — from fashion-inspired 
 mannequins to floral archways\, window displays\, and even edible creation
 s popping up where you least expect them.\nThis is not a formal tour.\nIt
 ’s a social walk — come explore\, take photos\, and enjoy the atmosphe
