 hat We’ll Do**\nWe’ll meet at the Toronto Reference Library and begin 
 our walk through Bloor-Yorkville\, following the floral trail and discover
 ing installations as we go.\nThere’s no rush — we’ll take our time\,
  stop for photos\, and enjoy the creativity throughout the neighbourhood.\
 nAfter the walk\, we’ll head over to Jack Astor's for food\, drinks\, an
 d a chance to hang out and connect. 🍔🍹\nYou’re welcome to join for
  food or head out whenever you like.\n\\*\\*\\*\n🌆 **Vibe & Expectation
 s**\nThis is an easy\, relaxed city walk — no distance pressure\, no int
 ensity.\nJust:\n✔️ Beautiful visuals\n✔️ A lively neighbourhood\n
 ✔️ Good company\nAlso — this is NOT a guided or historical tour. It
 ’s about enjoying the experience and being social.\n\\*\\*\\*\n**🧢 Me
 etup Details**\n📍 Meetup Location: Outside the Toronto Reference Librar
 y\n🫎 I’ll be wearing my Moose Hat\n⏰ Meetup Time: 11:00 AM\nI will 
