 r groups to so we can anticipate a terrific turn out.\n\\*Event details be
 low\n\\-\\-\\-\n**Location:**\n**Play Time Bowl**\n33 Samor Rd\, North Yor
 k\, ON M6A 1J2\n**Free Parking** found all around the location\n\\-\\-\\-\
 n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\nOrganizer/Host\n[meetup.com/soulcity/](h
 ttp://meetup.com/soulcity/)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Details:**\n**SATURDAY BOWLING with SINGLES
