 ng after (optional)\nAlso includes HST & Shoe Rental in the price)\n\\*Cas
 h only when you arrive\nor by e transfer in advance: **[steveflemming11@gm
 ail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com)**\n\\*10 dollars if you wish to
